{
    "info": {
        "name": "BG4.A - Receipts Surface (View / Reprint / Send / History)",
        "description": "BG4.A collection. Validates the four POS receipt endpoints introduced in `apps/api/src/modules/receipts`:\n- `GET /api/receipts/:id` — normalized receipt view with totals, items, payments, branch/org/footer, history counts. Audits `RECEIPT_VIEWED` (fire-and-forget).\n- `GET /api/receipts/:id/history` — paginated audit timeline (merges receipt-side + order-lifecycle rows).\n- `POST /api/receipts/:id/reprint` — wrapped via BG3 facade (category=null, idempotency optional). Audits `RECEIPT_REPRINTED`.\n- `POST /api/receipts/:id/send` — wrapped via BG3 facade. Returns 202 with `status: 'PENDING'`, `supported: false`, `reason: 'NO_LIVE_DELIVERY_ADAPTER'` (no live adapter wired this milestone). Audits `RECEIPT_SENT`.\n\nLocked rules verified:\n- `/api/auth/me` remains canonical context source (R14).\n- `POST /api/auth/login` accepts [200, 201] (R12).\n- New permissions: `pos:receipt:read | pos:receipt:reprint | pos:receipt:send` granted to Owner/Manager/Cashier/Waiter. **Chef intentionally denied** to verify role gating still enforces 403.\n- BG3 idempotency facade reused (NOT parallel). Reprint/send accept optional `Idempotency-Key`; replay returns the cached body byte-for-byte (same `deliveryId` for send).\n- No schema change. Receipt id == order id. Receipt history is derived from `AuditLog` (entityType `receipt` + order-lifecycle entries on entityType `order`).\n- Public diner payments still PENDING (out of scope here).\n- BG4.B (split / merge / transfer / move-items) is deferred to next prompt.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
